<title>SWEDEN: Trading suspended in Trygg-Hansa - bourse.</title>
<headline>Trading suspended in Trygg-Hansa - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm bourse said on Thursday that trading was suspended in Swedish insurer Trygg-Hansa.</p>
<p>The insurer is due to release its 1996 earnings later on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Trygg-Hansa shares last traded at 156 crowns on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A Reuters poll found the insurer was expected to post a pre-tax profit of 2.61 billion crowns for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>A comparison with 1995 profits was not relevant due to changes in accountancy rules.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
